  "facts": [
    {
      "id": "antigravity-through-runtime",
      "claim": "Antigravity chat is served through the llmgw-core Runtime with core's Antigravity vertical, the generalized OAuth credential store (renamed from the Codex store, Codex behavior unchanged) and core's NewAntigravityRefresh behind the gateway's refusal rules; image generation resolves the credential through the same store and coordinator and refreshes and replays once after a 401. The Antigravity refresh-lock table, refresh and project-persist code, token source, 401 handler and project observer are removed. Characterization goldens pass unchanged.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "go/internal/providers/antigravity.go, core_runtime.go, oauth_store.go; go/internal/api/testdata unchanged"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "parity-rules",
      "claim": "adaptAntigravityError is unchanged; a record without a stored profile is refused with the existing reauthorization error; a 401 whose refresh fails is reported as the existing status-less completion failure; the discovered project is persisted through ReplaceIfCurrent only while the stored token is unchanged; the catalog keeps the soft cache clear; mutation checks make the matching tests fail.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "go/internal/providers/antigravity_test.go and related tests"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "deviations",
      "claim": "Core runs the project hook only after a successful operation and the hook cannot fail the request, so a failed project write no longer fails the request; a refresh keeps the stored connection status, which every writer sets to active.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "llmgw-core v0.13.0 providers.AntigravityConfig.ProjectResolved; go/internal/providers/antigravity.go"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "suite",
      "claim": "The full Go suite passes with HTTP_PROXY and HTTPS_PROXY unreachable with unchanged characterization goldens; the providers iam.* budget moves from 75 to 59; gofmt, vet, govulncheck (0 reachable), check-docs and git diff --check pass.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "local gate run on the reviewed head"
      }
    }
  ],
